{"id":"classes-established-by-notice","title":"Classes the older notices created, with the salary they printed","tier":"REDFLAG","question":"For each class a notice of fiscal 2009 to 2016 created, what salary did it print, and how soon was anyone paid in it?","finding":"The saved notices establish 147 classes. Of the 79 established from fiscal 2013, when the payroll file begins, 34 have never had a paid holder and 20 were first paid within a year by one or two people. 34 carry an existing title with the tag SFERS added and were set up in December 2011 to February 2013; one notice’s file name reads “PERS to SFERS classes”.","how":"Every “Establish” item in the saved notices, with the salary as printed (biweekly ranges before 2012, annual after), matched to the City payroll by class number for the first fiscal year at or after the notice with a paid holder.","limits":"The notices give no reason for a new class and do not name the department that asked for it. A class never paid may be filled under another number or belong to a body outside the payroll file (the school district and City College use the City’s classes). The payroll file begins in fiscal 2013, so earlier classes cannot be followed from the start.","columns":[{"k":"code","t":"Class number","type":"text"},{"k":"title","t":"Title in the notice","type":"text"},{"k":"salary","t":"Salary printed","type":"text"},{"k":"date","t":"Notice took effect","type":"date"},{"k":"firstPaid","t":"First fiscal year paid","type":"year"},{"k":"holders","t":"Payroll rows that year","type":"int"},{"k":"notice","t":"Notice","type":"link"}],"rows":[{"code":"8520","title":"Sheriff (SFERS)","salary":"$7,652.61 B $7,652.61","date":"2011-12-08","firstPaid":2013,"holders":1,"notice":{"t":"Notice","u":"https://sfdhr.org/Modules/ShowDocument.aspx?documentID=14081"}},{"code":"8558","title":"Principal District Attorney’s Investigator (SFERS)","salary":"$3,799 B $4,848","date":"2011-12-16","firstPaid":2013,"holders":1,"notice":{"t":"Notice